action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P114 on WSL GTK (X11): Alt+Left with the caret in a text field still goes Back. On Linux and Windows a text field moves by word with Ctrl+Left and has no Alt+Left binding, so the key bubbles past GtkText to the Back controller, as in GNOME apps and browsers. (On macOS Option+Left is the field's word move instead; see mac/P114-textfield-alt-left.actions.) Steps wait 3 s: under WSLg a push takes about 3 s to land.
# Pass: replayed; the log shows depths 1 2 3, note: "ab cdx" (the field had the keys), then depth 2 -- and the note never changes after that.
# P114(WSL GTK,X11):插入點在文字框內時 Alt+Left 仍然返回。Linux 與 Windows 的文字框用 Ctrl+Left 逐字移動，沒有綁定 Alt+Left,所以按鍵越過 GtkText 傳到返回控制器，與 GNOME app 及瀏覽器相同(macOS 上 Option+Left 則是文字框的逐字移動，見 mac 版)。通過條件見上方英文。
sleep,,,,,,4000000,"let P114 settle: under WSLg 1.5 s missed the first taplabel twice, 4 s worked (2026-10-29)",gtk
taplabel,,,,,Open Fruits,,push Fruits (depth 1),gtk
sleep,,,,,,3000000,,gtk
taplabel,,,,,Open Untitled,,push Untitled (depth 2),gtk
sleep,,,,,,3000000,,gtk
taplabel,,,,,Open Leaf,,push Leaf (depth 3),gtk
sleep,,,,,,3000000,,gtk
taplabel,,,,,ab cd,,focus Leaf's text field (it holds ab cd),gtk
sleep,,,,,,800000,,gtk
key,,,,,rightArrow,,caret to the end (extra presses stay at the end),gtk
key,,,,,rightArrow,,caret to the end (extra presses stay at the end),gtk
key,,,,,rightArrow,,caret to the end (extra presses stay at the end),gtk
key,,,,,rightArrow,,caret to the end (extra presses stay at the end),gtk
key,,,,,rightArrow,,caret to the end (extra presses stay at the end),gtk
key,,,,,rightArrow,,caret to the end (extra presses stay at the end),gtk
sleep,,,,,,400000,,gtk
key,,,,,x,,type x at the end: note ab cdx proves the field has the keys,gtk
sleep,,,,,,600000,,gtk
keydown,,,,,option,,hold Alt,gtk
key,,,,,leftArrow,,Alt+Left with the caret in the field: Back pops Leaf (depth 2) -- no text field uses Alt+Left here,gtk
keyup,,,,,option,,,gtk
sleep,,,,,,3000000,,gtk
